[[File:Greater Bash icon.png|frame]]
{{Quotation|Spirit Breaker|Stunning, isn't it.|sound=vo_spirit_breaker_spir_ability_bash_03.mp3}}<section begin=intro /><dfn>Bash</dfn> is a passive ability that gives a unit a chance to [[stun]] its target on attack. Most bashes also include some extra damage upon proc. This damage is usually directly added to the attacking unit's attack damage. If it is directly added to the attack damage, the unit can [[lifesteal]] off of it and it is affected by attack damage reduction. However, it cannot [[crit]] or [[cleave]] and is not affected by attack damage increasing effects, damage block or [[Magic resistance#Magical Damage Barrier|magical damage barriers]].<section end=intro />

== Stacking ==
[[File:Stun.png|thumb|250px|[[Stun]] overhead effects.<br>The yellow effect is used by bash-based abilities.]]
<section begin=stacking />Multiple sources of bash do not stack, they proc independently from each other sources. When obtaining multiple items with the bash ability, only the one that has been continuously the longest in the inventory will proc the bash.<section end=stacking />

Although heroes with abilities that uses the bash mechanic are allowed to purchase items which provide bash (i.e. {{I|Skull Basher}} or {{I|Abyssal Blade}}), they are unable to proc bash from these items. For example:
* {{H|Faceless Void}}
* {{H|Slardar}}
* {{H|Spirit Breaker}}
* [[Illusions]]
* [[Clones]]

