=== Mute ===
[[File:Mute example.png|thumb|Tusk attempting to cast an item while muted.]]
As a counterpart to silence, a Mute disables the affected unit's active items in the same fashion as silence disables active abilities. As with silence, it does not affect passives at all. It does not stop already ongoing effects of items, but does cancel channeled items. Does not prevent [[Disassemble|disassembling]] in any way.

Mute also prevents the unit from toggling their items {{Key special|onoff}}.

Besides the listed abilities below, non-sharable [[items]] are always muted when picked up by a different unit than the owner.

All sources [[fear]] and [[hex]] will provide mute status.
