[[File:Crit.png|thumb|250px|{{H|Wraith King}} performing a critical strike.<br>The red number displays the resulting physical damage before reductions.]]
{{Main|Critical Strike}}
{{#lst:Critical Strike|main}} If an attack procs more than one source of critical strike, only the highest multiplier is applied.

